ta-colorid=nbv5hsttg1]{color:#252525} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=nbv5hsttg1]{color:#dadada}[data-colorid=iyipz0z7b6]{color:#252525} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=iyipz0z7b6]{color:#dadada}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-1.InstallBahmniConnectClient\">1.&nbsp;Install Bahmni Connect&nbsp;Client</h3><p>Bahmni Connect is currently supported via a Chromium extension or an Android App. Please refer to the details below to install and configure the client.</p><h4 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-a.ChromiumExtension\">a.&nbsp;Chromium Extension</h4><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"fbeedb19-6955-4578-b43d-db26a00c7acf\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><p class=\"title\">Deprecated</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Chromium Extension is deprecated. Please use Connect as either PWA running on Chrome browser on devices or install APK on Andrioid&nbsp;</p></div></div><p><br /></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f2436a7c-9166-45bc-99d4-e73bcaa3f980\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Bahmni Connect Chrome app is available only till Bahmni release 0.88. Subsequent releases of Bahmni Connect is available as <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535735/Installation+Steps+-+Client#InstallationSteps-Client-c.Progressivewebapp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progressive web app</a>.</p></div></div><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/extensions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium Extensions</a> are small software programs that can modify and enhance the functionality of the Chrome browser. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome_webstore/answer/2664769?hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow\">Here</a> are further&nbsp;details on installing and deleting extensions. Bahmni Connect&nbsp;has been tested on both a Windows chrome browser and a Mac chrome browser</p><p><strong>Steps to Install Chromium Extension</strong></p><ul><li><span data-colorid=\"bqs26evpas\">&alpha;-Release of c</span>hromium extension is now available at&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-offline-0.88-174.tar.gz\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-offline-0.88-174.tar.gz</a></li><li><p>Unzip bahmni.tar.gz</p></li><li>Navigate to&nbsp;<a rel=\"nofollow\">chrome://extensions</a></li><li><p>Expand the developer dropdown menu and click &quot;Load Unpacked Extension&quot;</p></li><li><p>Navigate to the local unzipped folder and click on 'Select' button.</p></li><li>Assuming there are no errors, the extension should load into your browser.</li></ul><h4 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-b.AndroidApp\">b. Android App</h4><p>Bahmni on Android is designed for tablets with very low resources such as minimal internal storage. Hence there is an option of storing the patient data in the&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Digital\" rel=\"nofollow\">SD card</a>.&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">SQLite</a>&nbsp;supports storing the data on the SD card. Since the SD card is easily accessible or transferrable, SQLite DB is encrypted. Copying the Bahmni.db file from the SD card and attempting to accessing the data&nbsp;is not possible because of the DB encryption.&nbsp;</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5ca46092-115c-4671-adf5-63f91da51c92\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Connect on Android doesn't save large observation forms which are more than&nbsp;1MB of size.</p></div></div><p><br /></p><p><strong>Steps to Install Bahmni Android App</strong></p><ul><li><span data-colorid=\"s9w0nbbg7m\">Android specific APK&nbsp;</span>is now available at&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-offline-0.88-174.apk\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-offline-0.88-174.apk</a></li><li>Connect Android device to PC via USB cable and turn on USB storage.</li><li>Copy bahmni.apk file to attached device's storage.</li><li>Turn off USB storage and disconnect it from PC.</li><li>Check the option Settings &rarr; Applications &rarr; Unknown sources.</li><li>Open FileManager app and click on the copied bahmni.apk file.</li><li>It will ask you whether to install this app or not. Click Yes or OK.</li></ul><h4 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-c.Progressivewebapp\">c. Progressive web app</h4><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d807ef91-2d68-44d1-85cb-bed0aeaf09a2\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Bahmni Connect Progressive web app is available from Bahmni release 0.89.</p></div></div><p><span data-colorid=\"vdczw5obbn\">Progressive Web App</span><span data-colorid=\"nbv5hsttg1\">&nbsp;takes advantage of new features supported by modern browsers, including Service Workers and Web App Manifests and allows the users to work offline. </span></p><p><span data-colorid=\"irsd1blo5w\">First time access of Bahmni Connect app requires network connection. During this first access to Bahmni Connect the service workers will cache the files needed for connect app to run in offline mode.</span></p><h5 id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-StepstoopenPWA\"><span data-colorid=\"qgv5vajt0u\"><strong>&nbsp;Steps to open PWA</strong></span></h5><ul><li><span data-colorid=\"fq7pk8yf20\">Access Bahmni Connect using url https://&lt;&lt;server ip&gt;&gt;/bahmni-connect.</span></li></ul><ul><li class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><span data-colorid=\"qgoitc5va1\">Once the files get successfully cached, the login page appears.</span></li></ul><h5 class=\"_mce_tagged_br\" id=\"InstallationSteps-Connect-StepstouninstallPWAinchrome\"><span data-colorid=\"obrrf5cd52\"><strong>&nbsp;Steps to uninstall PWA in chrome</strong></span></h5><ol><li class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><strong><span data-colorid=\"mr5bpi821n\"><span>Using Bahmni App:</span></span></strong></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c0c39490-88ad-4a18-82aa-dcdbeeb69330\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This feature is available from Bahmni Connect 0.90 release version</p></div></div><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span data-colorid=\"iyipz0z7b6\"><strong><br /></strong></span>Open User profile drop down in home page, click on <strong>Delete Connect App</strong> button. Then Confirmation dialog appears, click <strong>OK</strong> to delete the app.<br /><br /></p></li></ol><p class=\"_mce_tagged_br\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.31.02%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334937353&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=417&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.31.02%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334937353&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116533776\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-05-09 at 6.31.02 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"36\" data-media-id=\"e86f81ba-04ed-4460-8d56-013b04ceeb1e\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.31.02%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334937353&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=834&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.31.02%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334937353&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=417&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; After clicking on OK, below screen appears, then please close the tab. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p class=\"_mce_tagged_br\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.07.31%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334034733&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=170\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.07.31%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334034733&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116533229\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-05-09 at 6.07.31 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"36\" data-media-id=\"e769dc3f-d783-446b-8c84-8c83153896b2\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.07.31%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334034733&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=340 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-05-09%20at%206.07.31%20PM.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1494334034733&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=170 1x\" /></span><strong><span data-colorid=\"swc4fy3zvy\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><strong><span data-colorid=\"dqk08rt09v\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></strong><span data-colorid=\"n4hukica9f\"><span>2</span></span><strong><span data-colorid=\"dwm58z5muv\"><span>. Using Developer tools:</span></span></strong></p><ul><li class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><span data-colorid=\"l8ux5homt3\"><span data-colorid=\"g1i6lihhri\">Open the application, right click on the page</span></span></li><li class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><span data-colorid=\"eos4xxba50\"><span data-colorid=\"kfdwg91so8\">Menu box appears on the page, click on <strong>inspect </strong>option.</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"_mce_tagged_br\"><span data-colorid=\"eww3hllkef\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.44.46%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974474565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=428&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.44.46%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974474565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116068706\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-04-12 at 10.44.46 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"36\" data-media-id=\"d1f71ea5-4254-4e9d-947c-064eb12464f0\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.44.46%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974474565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=856&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.44.46%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974474565&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=428&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></span></p><ul><li class=\"_mce_tagged_br\">On clicking inspect, developer options will appear on the below or right side of the page. Then click on the <strong>Application </strong>tab<strong>.</strong>&nbsp;<br /><br /></li></ul><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.47.04%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974264618&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=434&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.47.04%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974264618&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116068649\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-04-12 at 10.47.04 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"36\" data-media-id=\"0bf41934-28d2-44fe-8974-89f75e83ce08\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.47.04%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974264618&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=868&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/94535735/Screen%20Shot%202017-04-12%20at%2010.47.04%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1491974264618&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=434&amp;height=250 1x\" /></span></p><ul><li>Go to <strong>Clear storage</strong> in Application tab.</li><li>Check all the boxes in clear storage and click on <strong>Clear Site data</strong>&nbsp;which will erase all the data of application.</li><li>Now close the tab and reopen the application.</li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 16.0px;font-weight: bold;\">2.&nbsp;Configure Bahmni Connect&nbsp;Client</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">The sync interval has to be configured for the Bahmni Connect&nbsp;Client. To do it, create a file named offline-config.json in '/openmrs/apps/home/' folder and add the required interval.</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c753afce-7edd-4b12-a709-d0886beaadd8\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n\t&quot;schedulerInterval&quot;: 40000\n}</pre>\n</div></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Config</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Values</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Description</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><strong>schedulerInterval</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">in milli-seconds</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">The Chromium app or Android app will behave like an &quot;offline first application&quot;, which means any data read or written happens to localDB first and will be synced to the server later. This property defines time interval for auto sync.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8450e577-7882-4e1b-ae52-c2950ec062ba\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"2ecf4e5d-ee5a-47a2-8fca-c2f2091f69d8\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c5e56f04-8483-4243-9c94-2e0ccc32752e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Pages</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"602551d1-0cc1-4658-980b-e2d0ce3814f7\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535706/Installing+Bahmni+Connect+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535706\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing Bahmni Connect on Server</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535723/Connect+Installation+Steps+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535723\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Connect Installation Steps on Server</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535719/Server+Setup+For+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535719\" data-linked-resource-version=\"30\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Server Setup For Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535725/Bahmni+Connect+Sync\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535725\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Connect Sync</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535730/Installing+Bahmni+Connect+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535730\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing Bahmni Connect App</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535733/Connect+Requirements\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535733\" data-linked-resource-version=\"23\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Connect Requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535735/Installation+Steps+-+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-version=\"36\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installation Steps - Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/325713930/Setup+Bahmni+Connect+using+Location+based+sync+strategy\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Setup Bahmni Connect using Location based sync strategy</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535739/Customizing+Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535739\" data-linked-resource-version=\"52\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Customizing Bahmni Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/97026058/Change+Bahmni+Connect+App+Location\" data-linked-resource-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Change Bahmni Connect App Location</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535737/Upgrade+Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535737\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Upgrade Bahmni Connect</a></li></ul></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a021349f-39d4-4c91-b255-2ab860ef23cd\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Connect Chromium Version 0.87 (&alpha; Release)</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p>You may download the .tar.gz file for Chromium App <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.tar.gz\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"fae0e63f-6c76-47ea-8557-1fbaf5727a73\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Connect APK Version 0.87 (&alpha; Release)</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p>You may download Connect APK <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bintray.com/bahmni/generic/download_file?file_path=bahmni-connect-0.87-8.apk\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535750/Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535750\" data-linked-resource-version=\"40\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Connect</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535745/Using+Bahmni+Connect+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535745\" data-linked-resource-version=\"34\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Using Bahmni Connect App</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
